{"task_id": "Mbpp/75", "solution": "def find_tuples(list_of_tuples: list[tuple[int, ...]], k: int) -> list[tuple[int, ...]]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds tuples where all elements are divisible by k from the given list of tuples.\n    Returns a new list containing only the tuples where all elements are divisible by k.\n    \"\"\"\n    result_tuples = []\n\n    if k == 0:\n        return []\n\n    for current_tuple in list_of_tuples:\n        all_divisible = True\n        for element in current_tuple:\n            if element % k != 0:\n                all_divisible = False\n                break\n\n        if all_divisible:\n            result_tuples.append(current_tuple)\n\n    return result_tuples"}
