{"task_id": "Mbpp/256", "solution": "def _is_prime(n: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Checks if a number is prime.\"\"\"\n    if n <= 1:\n        return False\n    if n <= 3:\n        return True\n    if n % 2 == 0 or n % 3 == 0:\n        return False\n    i = 5\n    while i * i <= n:\n        if n % i == 0 or n % (i + 2) == 0:\n            return False\n        i += 6\n    return True\ndef count_Primes_nums(number: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Counts the number of prime numbers strictly less than 'number'.\"\"\"\n    prime_count = 0\n    for i in range(2, number):\n        if _is_prime(i):\n            prime_count += 1\n    return prime_count"}
