{"task_id": "Mbpp/271", "solution": "def even_Power_Sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of the fifth powers of the first n even natural numbers.\n\n    Args:\n        n (int): The count of even natural numbers to consider.\n    \"\"\"\n    current_sum = 0\n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        even_num = 2 * i\n        powered_num = even_num ** 5\n        current_sum += powered_num\n    return current_sum"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/267", "solution": "def square_Sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the sum of the squares of the first n odd natural numbers.\n\n    Raises a ValueError if n is not a positive integer (n < 1).\n    \"\"\"\n    if n < 1:\n        raise ValueError(\"n must be a positive integer.\")\n\n    total_sum = 0\n    for i in range(n):\n        current_odd_number = 2 * (i + 1) - 1\n        squared_value = current_odd_number * current_odd_number\n        total_sum += squared_value\n    return total_sum"}
