{"task_id": "Mbpp/274", "solution": "import math\ndef even_binomial_Coeff_Sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of binomial coefficients C(n, k) for even indices k.\n    Iterates from k=0 up to n, adding C(n, k) to the total sum.\n    \"\"\"\n    total_sum = 0\n    for k in range(0, n + 1, 2):\n        total_sum += math.comb(n, k)\n    return total_sum"}
