{"task_id": "Mbpp/453", "solution": "def sumofFactors(number: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the sum of all even factors for a given integer.\n\n    Args:\n        number: The integer for which to find the sum of even factors.\n\n    Returns:\n        The sum of the even factors.\n    \"\"\"\n    sum_even_factors = 0\n    # Iterate up to the square root of the number to find factors efficiently.\n    for i in range(1, int(number**0.5) + 1):\n        if number % i == 0:\n            # If 'i' is a factor, check if it's even and add to sum.\n            if i % 2 == 0:\n                sum_even_factors += i\n\n            # Calculate the complementary factor.\n            complementary_factor = number // i\n            # If the complementary factor is different from 'i' and is even, add it to sum.\n            if complementary_factor != i and complementary_factor % 2 == 0:\n                sum_even_factors += complementary_factor\n    return sum_even_factors"}
