{"task_id": "Mbpp/457", "solution": "def Find_Min(list_of_lists: list) -> list:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the sublist with the minimum length from a given list of lists.\n    Returns None if the input list_of_lists is empty.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not list_of_lists:\n        return None\n\n    min_length = float('inf')\n    min_sublist = None\n\n    for current_sublist in list_of_lists:\n        current_length = len(current_sublist)\n        if current_length < min_length:\n            min_length = current_length\n            min_sublist = current_sublist\n\n    return min_sublist"}
