{"task_id": "Mbpp/555", "solution": "def difference(n):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the difference between the sum of cubes of the first n natural numbers\n    and the sum of the first n natural numbers.\n    \"\"\"\n    # Calculate sum of first n natural numbers: n * (n + 1) / 2\n    sum_n = n * (n + 1) // 2\n    \n    # Calculate sum of cubes of first n natural numbers: (n * (n + 1) / 2)^2\n    sum_cubes_n = sum_n * sum_n\n    \n    # Calculate the difference\n    return sum_cubes_n - sum_n"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/557", "solution": "def toggle_string(input_string: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Toggles the case of all alphabetic characters in a string.\n    Non-alphabetic characters remain unchanged.\"\"\"\n    toggled_chars = []\n    for char in input_string:\n        if char.isalpha():\n            if char.isupper():\n                toggled_chars.append(char.lower())\n            else:  # char.islower()\n                toggled_chars.append(char.upper())\n        else:\n            toggled_chars.append(char)\n    return \"\".join(toggled_chars)"}
