{"task_id": "Mbpp/559", "solution": "def max_sub_array_sum(list_of_numbers: list[int], length: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of the largest contiguous sublist using Kadane's algorithm.\n    The 'length' parameter is provided but not explicitly used in the iteration.\n    \"\"\"\n    global_max = float('-inf')\n    current_max = 0\n\n    for number in list_of_numbers:\n        current_max = max(number, current_max + number)\n        global_max = max(global_max, current_max)\n\n    return global_max"}
