{"task_id": "Mbpp/605", "solution": "def prime_num(number: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Determines if the given integer is a prime number.\n    Returns True if prime, False otherwise.\n    \"\"\"\n    if number <= 1:\n        return False\n    if number == 2:\n        return True\n    if number % 2 == 0:\n        return False\n    \n    i = 3\n    while i * i <= number:\n        if number % i == 0:\n            return False\n        i += 2\n    return True"}
