{"task_id": "Mbpp/608", "solution": "from .exceptions import InvalidInputError\ndef bell_Number(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the nth Bell number B(n).\n    Raises InvalidInputError if n is negative or not an integer.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(n, int) or n < 0:\n        raise InvalidInputError(\"Input 'n' must be a non-negative integer.\")\n\n    if n == 0:\n        return 1\n\n    bell = [[0 for _ in range(n + 1)] for _ in range(n + 1)]\n    bell[0][0] = 1\n\n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        bell[i][0] = bell[i-1][i-1]\n        for j in range(1, i + 1):\n            bell[i][j] = bell[i][j-1] + bell[i-1][j-1]\n\n    return bell[n][0]"}
