{"task_id": "Mbpp/758", "solution": "def unique_sublists(input_list: list[list]) -> dict[tuple, int]:\n    # Initialize a dictionary to store the frequency of each unique sublist.\n    frequencies = {}\n    for sublist in input_list:\n        # Convert each sublist to a tuple to use as a dictionary key.\n        sublist_tuple = tuple(sublist)\n        # Increment the count for the current tuple, initializing to 1 if not present.\n        frequencies[sublist_tuple] = frequencies.get(sublist_tuple, 0) + 1\n    return frequencies"}
