{"task_id": "Mbpp/805", "solution": "def max_sum_list(list_of_lists: list[list[int | float]]) -> list[int | float] | None:\n    \"\"\"\n    Identifies the list within a list of lists whose sum of elements is the highest.\n    Returns None if the input list_of_lists is empty.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not list_of_lists:\n        return None\n\n    max_sum = float('-inf')\n    highest_sum_list = None\n\n    for inner_list in list_of_lists:\n        current_sum = sum(inner_list)\n        if current_sum > max_sum:\n            max_sum = current_sum\n            highest_sum_list = inner_list\n    return highest_sum_list"}
